WEBVTT

00:13:00.020 --> 00:13:02.480
CC: Go hang out at recess
with some kindergartners.

00:13:02.504 --> 00:13:03.506
(Both laugh)

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:05.726
AG: Wait, I want adult recess.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:07.091
So I like this concept.

00:13:07.115 --> 00:13:08.527
(Conrey laughs)

00:13:08.551 --> 00:13:09.805
CC: Last week at recess,

00:13:09.829 --> 00:13:12.536
I started playing tag
with my kindergartners,

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:15.291
and I was in my high heels,
so it was probably ridiculous.

00:13:15.315 --> 00:13:16.322
(Both laugh)

00:13:16.346 --> 00:13:20.291
But it started out with, like,
three students, and all of the sudden,

00:13:20.315 --> 00:13:22.886
40 students wanted to play tag at recess,

00:13:22.910 --> 00:13:25.766
and we're all laughing
and playing together

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:30.556
and just really not a care
in the world and having fun.